{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03949","headline":"侍宴安乐公主庄应制 · 李适","name":"侍宴安乐公主庄应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平阳金牓凤皇楼，沁水银河鹦鹉洲。\n彩仗遥临丹壑里，仙舆暂幸绿亭幽。\n前池锦石莲花艳，後岭香鑪桂蘂秋。\n贵主称觞万年寿，还轻汉武济汾游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03949.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03949","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《御选唐诗》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/御選唐詩_(四庫全書本)）"}